# New Forever dungeon. Source: foreverchanges.pro/dungeons/shapers-terrace (level range is Blizzard's). The page lists
# 3 Horde quests, takeable from level 55, without their givers.
@dungeon Shaper's Terrace
@levels 58-60
@window 56-60
@best 58
@hub Un'Goro Crater, 45.0, 8.0, 10
@hub Orgrimmar, 50.0, 50.0
@hub Undercity, 66.0, 44.0
@entrance none
RUN @ Un'Goro Crater, 56, 12 | New Forever dungeon, not checked in game yet. It is in the hills of Un'Goro Crater; the entrance is reported by the northern pylon at about 56, 12. Its 3 Horde quests (from level 55) start elsewhere: Master Apothecary Faranell in Undercity (48.8, 69.3) gives The Dark Crystal, Chemist Fuely in Undercity (47.5, 73.4) gives Essence of Seeping Slimes, and Mayena Earthseeker in Mulgore (about 34.9, 22.1) gives Crystalline Elements. Take what is offered; the addon logs it so these steps can be filled in.
